        "title": "Amnesia: The Bunker",
        "extract": "Amnesia: The Bunker is a 2023 survival horror video game developed and published by Frictional Games. The fourth installment in the Amnesia series and a prequel to Amnesia: Rebirth (2020), the game follows a French soldier who is trapped in a bunker with a monster and must find a way to escape. It was released for Windows, PlayStation 4, Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S on June 6, 2023. It received generally positive reviews from critics.\n\n",
